Package: R8.io
Title: Read and Write Table Files with 'R8' Types
Version: 0.6.0.9000
Date: 2026-11-25
Authors@R: c(
    person(given = "E.D.", family = "Gennatas", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
           email = "gennatas@gmail.com",
           comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0001-9280-3609")),
    person(given = "Authors of the bundled Rust crates", role = c("ctb", "cph"),
           comment = "Rust crates compiled into the package; see inst/AUTHORS")
    )
Description: Readers and writers of table files for the types of 'R8'. A column is
    read as its declared type, and each text that does not read is reported once,
    with its count and its first rows, for the user to give what it reads as. A
    column without a declared type has the type that all its cells have, and is text
    otherwise.
URL: https://docs.rtemis.org/r/r8/file-read.html,
    https://www.rtemis.org, https://github.com/rtemis-org/r8
BugReports: https://github.com/rtemis-org/r8/issues
